# ============================================================================
# Facebook OAuth Testing
# ============================================================================

### Step 1: Login to Get JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alwa%40gmail.com&password=ali123

### Step 2: Get Facebook OAuth URL (Copy JWT token from Step 1 response)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/integrations/facebook/connect
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoiMSIsImV4cCI6MTc3NzUyMzE1MH0.IvtjZQeLc_4LLfIru1b6SWwNFXUolzsJ2JoF6k4thwQ

### Step 3: Open Facebook OAuth URL in Browser
# The response from Step 2 will give you an oauth_url
# Copy that URL and open it in your browser (NO token needed)
# You'll see Facebook login and page selection
# After approval, Facebook redirects to the callback (your backend handles it)

### Step 4: Verify Integration Saved
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/integrations
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoiMSIsImV4cCI6MTc3NzE4MDk4N30.MN5HJ3Q3TzVAMUyTUvLEoojSui4WNMsl0p-MUbBJ9H4


