# Alternative Login Format (JSON instead of URL-encoded)
# ============================================================================

### Login Alternative - JSON format
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alwa@gmail.com",
  "password": "ali123"
}
